    "name": "📌 Luma AI API",
    "description": "### About Luma AI\n\n\"Luma AI is the creative AI platform for video generation and image creation.\"\n\nLuma AI builds its own Ray video and Uni image models. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Image & video**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Luma AI Account: [https://lumalabs.ai/api](https://lumalabs.ai/api)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `luma_ai_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:luma_ai_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://docs.agents.lumalabs.ai/](https://docs.agents.lumalabs.ai/)\n    \n- Models: [https://docs.agents.lumalabs.ai/guides/model](https://docs.agents.lumalabs.ai/guides/model)\n\n### Notes\n\nGeneration is asynchronous: **Generations / Get generation** polls `temp.generation_id` until `state` is `completed`.",
